{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>All.</b> The sense of לכל (for all) is: for all the utensils of the tabernacle, all the utensils that serve the needs of the tabernacle, and the pegs of the tent and the pegs of the courtyard — copper. And likewise the hammers."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:42.624304977Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}